e and hold some events, we could pique others' interest and also lighten up our image!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_phantom_15_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_phantom_15_13","text":"A thief-themed event sounds fun, don't you think?","jump":"d_counseling_phantom_15_14","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_phantom_15_14","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_phantom_15_14","text":"I spend time with Phantom brainstorming how to increase people's reading.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"}]}